10.text:
{B1}

1.W B1 is the only first point that puts the C1–C2 chain in effective atari on the unique connecting point B2 and gives W B1 the two breathing points A1,B2.

Gc = C1–C2 has L = {B1,B2} → after 1.W B1 L(Gc) = {B2}
Ga = A2 has L = {A1,A3,B2}
Gb = B3–B4 has L = {A3,A4,B2}
W B1 has L = {A1,B2}

Any 2... ≠ B2 leaves Gc with the sole unplayable liberty B2 and 2.W B2 captures C1–C2 at once, so

2...B B2

is forced. B2 is legal, it joins Ga,Gb,Gc into

M = A2 B2 B3 B4 C1 C2    L(M) = {A1,A3,A4}

and W B1 is now in atari on A1, L(W B1)={A1}.

The corner net is now forced on A1/A3/A4. Up to symmetry

3.W A4 4.B A1 captures W B1 → M on A3,B1, W A4 on A3,A5
5.W A3 removes A3 from M, M is on B1 only and B B1 is self-atari, so 6.W B1 captures M.

The symmetric 3.W A3 4.B A4, 3.W A3 4.B A1 etc. close in the same way; any 4th Black move ≠ A1/A3 leaves M in atari on A1 and White wins by 4.W A3 5.W B1 or 4.W A1.

1.W B2 is met by 2.B B1 capturing W B2, 1.W A3 is met by 2.B A4, 1.W A4 is met by 2.B B2, A1 is suicide. On a normal board the D1–D2 white two lives on E1,E2,D3, so 1.W D3 is not forced. Hence B1 is the unique first move that initiates a forced killing sequence of the A2,B3–B4,C1–C2 complex.

2.text:
{}

On a normal board D1–D2 lives on E1/E2/D3 so the right-hand side is not a forced
defence. The three black corner formations are

Ga=A2   L={A1,A3,B2}
Gb=B3–B4 L={A3,A4,B2}
Gc=C1–C2 L={B1,B2}

which meet only at B2.

1.W B1 2.B B2 is legal.  B2 is not an isolated suicide, it joins
A2,B3–B4,C1–C2 into

M=A2 B2 B3 B4 C1 C2    L(M)={A1,A3,A4}

and leaves W B1 in atari on A1, L(W B1)={A1}.  W A3 is then in atari on A4.
* 3.W A3 4.B A1 captures W B1.  M is on A4,B1 and W A3 is on A4;
5.W A4 6.W B1 is the usual snap-back, but Black can instead
* 3.W A3 4.B A4 capture W A3.  M now has L={A1,A3,B1,A5} and W B1 stays
on A1.  The net is mutual and Black keeps ≥2 liberties on the united mass.

The same mutual snap-back holds for the other net points:

1.W B2 2.B B1 captures W B2 and unites B1 to C1–C2 with
L={A1,A3,A4,B2};
1.W A3 2.B A4/A4 2.B B2 restores the united Ga Gb Gc mass with
L⊇{A1,A3,A4,B1};
1.W A4 2.B B2 unites Ga Gb Gc to L={A1,A3,B1}.

In every line Black can legally connect on B2 and recapture a sacrificial
White stone on A1/A3/A4/B1/B2, keeping at least two liberties on the
A2–B3–B4–C1–C2 complex. No first White point creates an irreversible atari
on a Black group against best defence, so there is no killing initiation.

